'''Leaf''' (Japanese: '''リーフ''' ''Leaf'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, the Retreat Cost of your Active Pokémon is 2 less.
}}

