==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|X Speed}} has a less potent version of this card's effect, but as an {{TCGP|Item card}} instead of a {{TCGP|Supporter card}}.
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Air Balloon}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card is a Supporter card rather than a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool card}}, so only applies for one turn rather than perpetually.

===Origin===
*{{ga|Leaf}} is the female [[player character]] in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}. Leaf's pink [[Vs. Seeker]] is visible on her bag's strap.

